  - Bangladesh
abstract: >-
  Python code that builds SPEI-3, SPEI-6 and SPEI-12 for the eight divisions of
  Bangladesh from ERA5 monthly data (1980-2024), tests ERA5 against 35 Bangladesh
  Meteorological Department stations, screens the predictors, and trains five models
  (XGBoost, CNN, Bi-LSTM, CNN-BiLSTM and CEEMDAN-BiLSTM) with five seeds at leads of
  1-3 months (135 runs, test period 2019-2024). It applies the model-selection rule
  fixed in advance, circular block bootstrap intervals, Diebold-Mariano tests and
  SHAP, and rebuilds every table and figure of the paper.
